<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Insert title here</title>
<!-- 부트스트랩 아이콘 -->
<link rel="stylesheet" 
  href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index.css">
</head>
<body>
	
<div id="wrap">
<header class="max-container">
<i class="bi bi-apple"></i>
<nav>
<a href="#store" >스토어</a>
                <a href="#mac" >Mac</a>
                <a href="#ipad" >iPad</a>
                <a href="#iphone" >iPhone</a>
                <a href="#watch" >Watch</a>
                <a href="#airpods" >AirPods</a>
                <a href="#support">고객지원</a>

</nav>

<div class="icons">
<i class="bi bi-search"></i>
<i class="bi bi-bag-fill"></i>
</div>
</header>

<main class="max-container">
<h1>iPhone 16 Pro</h1>
<h3>티타늄.강인함.가벼움.Prooo.</h3>
<div class="btns">
<button>더 알아보기</button>
<button>장바구니</button>
</div>

<div class="main-image">
<img alt="아이폰이미지" 
     src="/image/mainImage.avif">
</div>

<section class="second-page max-container">

	<h1>나에게 맞는 Pro 모델 커스텀</h1>
	<h3>원하는 마감 및 용량을 선택하여 실시간 가격을 확인하세요</h3>	

<div class= "custom-select">
	<div class="custom-image">
		<img alt="/image/mainImage.avif" src="">
		<h3>내추럴 티타늄</h3>
	</div>
</div>	

<div>	
	<div class="custom-option-color">
		<h4>1. 마감 선택</h4>
		<button class="btn-sand"></button>
		<button class="btn-ibory"></button>
		<button class="btn-white"></button>
		<button class="btn-gray"></button>
	</div>
	
	<div class="custom-option-storige">
		<h4>2. 저장 용량 선택</h4>
		<button>
			<p>128GB</p>
			<p><span>기본 용량</span></p>
		</button>
		<button>
			<p>256GB</p>
			<p><span>+ 원150,000</span></p>
		</button>
		<button>
			<p>512GB</p>
			<p><span>+ 원450,000</span></p>
		</button>
	</div>
	
	<div class="custom-option-price">
		<div class="custom-option-price-text">
			<h4>총 예상 금액</h4>
			<p>원1,550,000</p>
		</div>
		<div class="custom-option-price-btn">
			<button>장바구니 담기</button>
		</div>
	</div>	
</div>

</section>




</main>




</div>
	
<script src="/js/index.js"></script>	
